What the audit ran.
- The first launch under heavy-run with p2 and a 1800 s limit. The scratch container uxpcls-1794391715-171794 ran on host port 40505. The migration exited 0. The seed wrote one school, one teacher, one class and two students. The shared databases and port 5432 stayed untouched.
